      "caption": "One file on hardware you own. Copy it, back it up, take it with you.",
      "narration": "One file, on your disk, behind a local sign-in. Copy it, back it up, take it with you.",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Store",
          "value": "SQLite on your disk"
